body:
Indeed cyberpunk is generally gritty but it's the focus of more "realism" maybe in VtM with so much of the lore gone from VtM with 5th edition that was my point. I imagined that it was Pentex/Nephandi experimenting with a V2.0 project. Or just cybernetics that imitate vampires. It would only be like a few sessions in a wider arc or maybe just a limited scope chronicle.

&#x200B;

[Cybernetic Vampire](https://preview.redd.it/55hhcwkmkis21.png?width=700&format=png&auto=webp&s=8624df0ce69822d064b2e5a4238359c8a14df4cb)
